<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATE STEADY OR LOWER AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATE STEADY OR LOWER AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates were</p>
<p>flat or a shade lower at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on</p>
<p>Wednesday. The three-month rate fell to 3.33 percent.</p>
<p>					Sept 11 fix	    Sept 10 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.25 pct		3.25 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.28 pct		3.28 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.33 pct		3.34 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.48 pct		3.48 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.62 pct		3.63 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.72 pct		3.73 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
